<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Key mission locations</name><description>This map contains the objective locations, enemy and friendly positions, and linking elements for RETREAT, HELL and THREAT IMMINENT. The revised layer adds the Russian forward scout team and UAV-operator position engaged by Frost from his second overwatch position. All unrelated mission geography and objective flow remain unchanged.</description><Folder><name>Key mission locations</name><Placemark><name>Enemy scout team and UAV-operator position</name><description>A Russian forward scout team with a UAV operator is covertly approaching the power plant from the west through the open coal-storage area immediately south of the main power-plant building. Ducky, Lupin, and Switchblade must avoid detection long enough for Frost, firing from his second overwatch position on the roof of the northern power-plant block, to eliminate the UAV operator and the scout-team leader. The ground team then engages and clears the remaining scouts. This is an NPC support action and does not trigger Frost's playable perspective transition; that later transition occurs from his third overwatch position against the naval-fire observation team.</description><styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>4.0222928,51.9603852,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder></Document></kml>